  "body": "Tucked away in a quiet street of Silverdale, this brand-new home offers easy living with every local amenity right at your doorstep. Whether you are a first-home buyer or a savvy investor, this affordable gem is the opportunity you’ve been waiting for.\r\n\r\nThe Home Highlights:\r\n\r\n• 4 Bedrooms & 2.5 Bathrooms: Includes a master with ensuite. The family bathroom features a striking skylight, flooding the space with natural light.\r\n• Guest Toilet: A separate toilet on the ground level adds extra practicality for visitors.\r\n• Modern Open-Plan Living: A sleek kitchen flows seamlessly into the dining and living areas, the social heart of the home.\r\n• Seamless Outdoor Flow: Step out from the living area onto your private deck, backing onto a lush green reserve for great peace and privacy.\r\n\r\nThe Location:\r\n\r\n• Walking distance to the Silverdale Bus Station\r\n• 2 Minutes to the motorway for an easy commute.\r\n• 4 Minutes to Silverdale Shopping Centre, supermarkets, and local cafes.\r\n\r\nThis is an affordable gem in a highly sought-after area, this property truly ticks all the boxes.\r\n\r\nContact us now to arrange your private viewing and secure your future in Silverdale!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
